1
00:00:00,972 --> 00:00:03,342
(Raj:)Like, I love me
some Clooney.

2
00:00:03,341 --> 00:00:05,741
(Leonard:)Don't say that to anyone.

3
00:00:07,979 --> 00:00:10,349
(Penny:)Thank you so much
for helping us, Stuart.

4
00:00:10,348 --> 00:00:12,048
Oh, I-I was just

5
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:13,720
(Stuart:)glad to be invited.

6
00:00:13,718 --> 00:00:16,758
(Stuart:)To be honest, I don't always
feel like I'm part of the group.

7
00:00:16,755 --> 00:00:17,925
(Penny:)Okay, sweetie,
we're on the clock here.

8
00:00:17,923 --> 00:00:20,423
(Penny:)Can you hate yourself
and frost at the same time?

9
00:00:20,425 --> 00:00:21,725
(door opens)

10
00:00:21,726 --> 00:00:24,256
Hello, I hope I'm not too early.

11
00:00:24,262 --> 00:00:25,192
(Bernadette:)No, no, no. Come on in.

12
00:00:25,197 --> 00:00:27,767
And how is the radiant
mommy-to-be?

13
00:00:27,766 --> 00:00:29,236
(Bernadette:)Doing great.

14
00:00:29,234 --> 00:00:31,264
Y-You're pregnant?

15
00:00:31,269 --> 00:00:32,239
(Penny:)Yeah.

16
00:00:32,237 --> 00:00:34,237
(Stuart:)Sounds like something

17
00:00:34,239 --> 00:00:37,209
(Stuart:)a member of the group
might know.

18
00:00:37,209 --> 00:00:38,479
(Penny:)Yeah, birthday party first.

19
00:00:38,477 --> 00:00:40,547
(Penny:)Pity party later.

20
00:00:43,115 --> 00:00:44,345
(Leonard:)Are you crazy?

21
00:00:44,349 --> 00:00:46,049
(Leonard:)How can you put Michael Keaton

22
00:00:46,051 --> 00:00:48,381
(Leonard:)in front of Christian Bale?

23
00:00:48,386 --> 00:00:50,556
(Adam West:)Oh, please.

24
00:00:52,524 --> 00:00:56,024
(Adam West:)Even my poodles know
Bale's overrated.

25
00:00:56,027 --> 00:00:58,097
Thank you!

26
00:00:58,096 --> 00:00:59,996
(Raj:)That's why I say
Keaton's number one.

27
00:00:59,998 --> 00:01:01,668
(Raj:)He brought a sense
of humor to the role.

